rmat%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5193443ca07f3865a46d210a28f7951, https://si.imgix.net/8ccb2b97/uploads/origins/c3746d42-7dd8-4041-951b-1454cb8cd7bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ed65e6e87f2f4956332162a528ac897 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8ccb2b97/uploads/origins/c3746d42-7dd8-4041-951b-1454cb8cd7bf?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fa915905206647c737223dfede4dac4a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello ! I really like your artwork and would be very happy if you would draw my original character.\nPlease draw her wearing the metal armor suite attached, in a war scene in the snow.\n\nThe character is a  young queen of a kingdom， She is about 16 or 17 years old.\nShe has red hair like flames, and eyes as blue as the sky.\nShe's young and determined. She has the strength and determination to lead her subjects and never give up on anything.  But that doesn't mean she is a cold person, on the contrary, she treats people with kindness and sincerity outside the battlefield.\nAs a commender on the battlefield, her weapon is thunder magic and a spear.\nThank you so much.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-0O2D8QzpRL_Ab8YX2Fzlq_LYKLVyZFI?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kCKvyRf3JqEmVtj/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/07205dff/uploads/origins/89aedf88-33f6-49bd-a94f-7d168b00558c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0fb064a728506cc308101746ca6f8e7b", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/07205dff/uploads/origins/89aedf88-33f6-49bd-a94f-7d168b00558c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=0fb064a728506cc308101746ca6f8e7b, https://si.imgix.net/